{"data":[{"author_id":"1989516198363717632","created_at":"2026-10-14T15:19:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110390128141037907"],"id":"2110390128141037907","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":69,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"M2、社融、贷款，经常被混成一个词，\n其实是三个水位计。\nM2看社会上钱的总量，\n贷款看银行借出去了多少，\n社融看企业和政府从整个金融体系融到了多少钱。\nM2涨但社融弱，\n往往说明钱在金融系统里转，\n还没真正流进实体生意里。","url":"https://x.com/choiceone88/status/2110390128141037907"},{"author_id":"2054370712480108544","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:27:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110316610124939759"],"id":"2110316610124939759","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":17,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国 9 月金融数据出来，和上午的物价数据是同一个故事。\n\n· M2 同比 +7.2%，M1 同比 +3.2% —— 剪刀差 4.0 个百分点\n· M0 同比 +10.6%，是三个口径里最快的\n· 1–9 月社融增量 27.46 万亿元，去年同期 23.91 万亿元\n· 9 月单月：社融约 3.55 万亿元，新增人民币贷款约 1.08 万亿元\n\n三个观察：","url":"https://x.com/INVESTMINGX/status/2110316610124939759"},{"author_id":"913179974806450176","created_at":"2026-10-13T13:14:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109996219435299128"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/CDTChinese/sta…","end":66,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/CDTChinese/status/2109922312959254711","start":43,"url":"https://t.co/cYnud8kxJb"}]},"id":"2109996219435299128","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1067,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"纽交所上市的宜人贷老板也被抓了。银行放贷都放不出去了，社融持续大幅萎缩，能不暴雷吗。 https://t.co/cYnud8kxJb","url":"https://x.com/zptgddq/status/2109996219435299128"},{"author_id":"1449103717081370630","created_at":"2026-10-14T16:24:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110406380427550881"],"id":"2110406380427550881","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"前三季度社融增量 27.46 万亿元，人民币贷款新增 11.52 万亿元，总量同比回落。融资结构发生显著变化，直接融资占比抬升并超过信贷，政府债券成为社融第一支柱，企业债券、股权融资回暖。信贷呈现明显分化：企业部门加杠杆托底信贷总量，但住户贷款净减少 1.03","url":"https://x.com/Rishav2924/status/2110406380427550881"},{"author_id":"1447499448649601025","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:53:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110353293432250433"],"id":"2110353293432250433","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2937,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":4},"text":"9月社融数据也是刚出，可以说中国前三季度社融同比少了2.63万亿元，拆开来看，居民贷款从去年净增1.1万亿元，变成了净减1.03万亿元，增量同比少了约2.13万亿元，企事业单位贷款少增8900亿元，其中中长期贷款少增1.76万亿元。","url":"https://x.com/LVTGW666/status/2110353293432250433"},{"author_id":"1982982157162426372","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:42:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110229679269630287"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":58,"start":55,"tag":"A股"}]},"id":"2110229679269630287","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":115,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"数据点评：最新CPI温和，给了政策更从容的空间。但市场更关心政策何时兑现成信用扩张，光有预期不够，要看社融。 #A股","url":"https://x.com/jack1191484/status/2110229679269630287"},{"author_id":"1550195095793958913","created_at":"2026-10-14T13:37:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110364426281099766"],"id":"2110364426281099766","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":47,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国人民银行数据显示，9月末社融存量为468.17万亿元，同比增长7.1%。\n\n其中，对实体经济发放的人民币贷款余额279.9万亿元，同比增长4.8%。\n\n如果这个趋势持续到年底，中国经济2027年应该要好起来了。","url":"https://x.com/theRemyLi/status/2110364426281099766"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110310590791249920","3_2110310590799548416","3_2110310590816428032"]},"author_id":"1401412511614767107","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:03:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110310622525366720"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":12,"start":7,"tag":"社会融资"},{"end":22,"start":19,"tag":"社融"},{"end":63,"start":60,"tag":"M2"},{"end":72,"start":69,"tag":"M1"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/UaaGtJZKr7","end":184,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/justice_trail/status/2110310622525366720/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110310590791249920","start":161,"url":"https://t.co/UaaGtJZKr7"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/UaaGtJZKr7","end":184,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/justice_trail/status/2110310622525366720/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110310590799548416","start":161,"url":"https://t.co/UaaGtJZKr7"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/UaaGtJZKr7","end":184,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/justice_trail/status/2110310622525366720/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110310590816428032","start":161,"url":"https://t.co/UaaGtJZKr7"},{"display_url":"x.com/justice_trail/…","end":208,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/justice_trail/status/2099642290885296397","start":185,"url":"https://t.co/E6nygRBlOU"}]},"id":"2110310622525366720","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":569,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":18},"text":"中共公布9月 #社会融资 数据：\n➡️#社融 增3.55万亿，人民币贷款增1.08万亿；政府债券融资1.53万亿！\n➡️#M2 7.3%，#M1 3.2%，剪刀差再扩大！\n➡️居民部门：短期贷款减少-900亿，中长期增874亿。\n➡️企业部门：短期增4600亿，中长期增8900亿。\n社会融资的增速、M2和M1都在下降！ https://t.co/UaaGtJZKr7 https://t.co/E6nygRBlOU","url":"https://x.com/justice_trail/status/2110310622525366720"},{"author_id":"3302713589","created_at":"2026-10-14T06:15:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110253017429864448"],"id":"2110253017429864448","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股最近表现弱势就三句话：\n\n钱在撤。​ 近20日沪市主力资金净流出约1808亿、创业板约718亿，没人接盘。\n\n经济偏冷。​ 8月社融增量同比降9.96%，房地产投资-19.9%、汽车消费-13.9%；9月制造业PMI 50.1刚踩荣枯线，非制造业新订单46.5仍在收缩。地产和消费两大引擎还没点火。\n\n杀估值不杀业绩。","url":"https://x.com/Maksek1234/status/2110253017429864448"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110365249412952064"]},"author_id":"1768147099370029056","created_at":"2026-10-14T13:42:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110365587335516651"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":162,"start":158,"tag":"币界网"},{"end":167,"start":163,"tag":"cpi"}],"mentions":[{"end":157,"id":"1630094011863281664","start":150,"username":"528btc"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/8RaqLHfYsi","end":191,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/xiyan555084/status/2110365587335516651/video/1","media_key":"13_2110365249412952064","start":168,"url":"https://t.co/8RaqLHfYsi"}]},"id":"2110365587335516651","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"币界网美股消息报道，美国9月消费者物价指数（CPI）同比增长3.7%，核心CPI同比增长2.6%，均超出市场预期，导致10月加息预期飙升。与此同时，中国9月社融新增3.55万亿元，人民币贷款新增1.08万亿元，环比双双大幅回升。日经225指数收跌0.05%，沪指收跌0.88%，恒指收跌0.13%。\n@528btc #币界网 #cpi https://t.co/8RaqLHfYsi","url":"https://x.com/xiyan555084/status/2110365587335516651"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110350620234514433"]},"author_id":"464646709","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:43:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110350689054675175"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/zlgcpqeuJt","end":173,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/peralta29r/status/2110350689054675175/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110350620234514433","start":150,"url":"https://t.co/zlgcpqeuJt"}]},"id":"2110350689054675175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"收盘以后，央行公布经济数据，注意几个要点：\n\n1、信贷从\"冰点\"回到正常， 8月新增贷款仅600亿，9月回到1.08万亿，对股市是利好；\n\n2、 融资结构\"换锚\"仍在深化。1-9月债券+股票融资占社融增量49.48%，超过贷款约7个百分点，说明资本市场正在取代银行，直白一点就是融资市场，你们懂的！ https://t.co/zlgcpqeuJt","url":"https://x.com/peralta29r/status/2110350689054675175"},{"author_id":"852245268389126144","created_at":"2026-10-14T11:27:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110331756348080402"],"id":"2110331756348080402","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":19360,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":4},"text":"收盘以后，央行公布经济数据，注意几个要点：\n1、信贷从\"冰点\"回到正常，​ 8月新增贷款仅600亿，9月回到1.08万亿，对股市是利好；\n2、 融资结构\"换锚\"仍在深化。1-9月债券+股票融资占社融增量49.48%，超过贷款约7个百分点，说明资本市场正在取代银行，直白一点就是融资市场，你们懂的！","url":"https://x.com/Jwaher49783608/status/2110331756348080402"},{"author_id":"2030893341362249728","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:44:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110305812388204693"],"id":"2110305812388204693","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":36,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行投放7000亿，M2增长7.2%，为什么投资者还没明显热起来？\n\n关键在于：钱的总量和钱的流动速度，是两回事。\n\n9月末，M2同比增长7.2%，M1却只有3.2%，两者相差4个百分点。社融存量增长7.1%，实体人民币贷款余额增速仅4.8%，政府债券余额增速则达到13.7%。数据来源⁠￼","url":"https://x.com/lwqbepk/status/2110305812388204693"},{"author_id":"1932288456899612672","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:06:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110160229174550999"],"id":"2110160229174550999","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"1.央行主要创造基础货币，商业银行可以通过信用扩张创造存款货币。\n2.贷款会创造存款，偿还贷款本金会消灭相应存款。\n3.银行不能无限创造贷款，受到资本、流动性、风险、监管和借款需求约束。\n4.M1更偏“活钱”，M2包含更广泛的货币和潜在购买力；M2增长不等于经济一定活跃。","url":"https://x.com/JBrianP_256/status/2110160229174550999"},{"author_id":"1141928049849425921","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:50:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110427979847500166"],"id":"2110427979847500166","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大收税时代来了。\n\n据财新，2027年的中国公务员考试，税务系统招录占比升至67.28%再创历史新高，行政执法类岗位占比首次突破79%，计划投向县（区）级及以下机构的岗位占比站上75%台阶，招录资源加速向税务系统和基层一线集中的结构性特征进一步凸显。","url":"https://x.com/zhangsheng5w/status/2110427979847500166"},{"author_id":"137332930","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:20:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110345045987701056"],"id":"2110345045987701056","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":8439,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今日中国A股热点二十条\n（一）\n1、据东方财富报道，国家统计局公布9月CPI同比上涨0.9%，PPI同比上涨5%，其中AI算力需求带动电子制造提价，汽油价格上涨16.6%。","url":"https://x.com/cnfinancewatch/status/2110345045987701056"},{"author_id":"10713142","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:02:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110310213584814271"],"id":"2110310213584814271","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":159,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"总体市场评分：5.5/10（方向性情绪：+0.5）\n\n主要偏多因素：\nFed官员Bowman表示无需立即采取进一步利率行动，政策路径清晰，市场对美联储立场预期稳定。\n中国1-9月新增人民币贷款11.52万亿元、社融27.46万亿元均超预期，融资需求稳健支撑全球增长预期。\nMorgan","url":"https://x.com/fwteam/status/2110310213584814271"},{"author_id":"2295669319","created_at":"2026-10-14T16:07:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110402044310008218"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":20,"start":12,"tag":"mybro简报"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/mybrobot/statu…","end":189,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/mybrobot/status/2110041229161549882","start":166,"url":"https://t.co/ONY3sDwc1y"}]},"id":"2110402044310008218","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":270,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年10月15日 #mybro简报，星期四，农历九月初六，早安！\n\n1. 央行：9月末社融存量为468.17万亿元，同比增长7.1%，广义货币(M2)余额359.63万亿元人民币，同比增长7.2%，狭义货币(M1)余额116.76万亿元，同比增长3.2%，流通中货币(M0)余额15.02万亿元，同比增长10.6%。\n\n2. https://t.co/ONY3sDwc1y","url":"https://x.com/mybrobot/status/2110402044310008218"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110329689277374465"]},"author_id":"537569607","created_at":"2026-10-14T11:20:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110329883209695481"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"一、社会融资规模存量同比增长7.1%初步统计。9月末对实体经济发放的人民币贷款余额占同期社会融资规模存量的59.8%。对实体经济发放的外币贷款折合人民币余额占比0.3%。委托贷款余额占比2.4%。信托贷款余额占比1%。四、前三季度人民币存款增加20.76万亿元9月末。月末人民币存款余额349.45万亿元。前三季度人民币存款增加20.76万亿元。五、前三季度人民币贷款增加11.52万亿元9月末。","display_url":"pbc.gov.cn/goutongjiaoliu…","end":116,"expanded_url":"https://www.pbc.gov.cn/goutongjiaoliu/113456/113469/2026101415422529740/index.html","start":93,"status":200,"title":"2026年前三季度金融统计数据报告","unwound_url":"https://www.pbc.gov.cn/goutongjiaoliu/113456/113469/2026101415422529740/index.html","url":"https://t.co/jt0u66gOva"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/n3ABCxEVaJ","end":140,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/hermesstrategy/status/2110329883209695481/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110329689277374465","start":117,"url":"https://t.co/n3ABCxE